                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.00/1802: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Reed</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-09"
                            >September 9, 1943</date>.<lb/>[Received September 9—8:54
                        p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2083. It is officially announced that resignation of Foreign Minister Storni has
                    been presented and accepted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reed</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
